   "short": "Airbnb: analysis + Value Proposition Canvas",
   "q": "Airbnb operates as a peer-to-peer marketplace that connects hosts looking to rent out their properties with guests seeking short-term accommodations. Hosts list their spaces, ranging from rooms to entire homes, while guests browse and book through the platform. Airbnb generates revenue by charging service fees to both hosts and guests. The platform enhances trust through features like secure payments and reviews, while its asset-light model allows global scalability without owning any properties. <b>Analyse Airbnb's business model and create Value Proposition Canvas.<\/b> (15 marks)",
