   "short": "Pitching to venture capitalists: four key aspects",
   "q": "<i>&ldquo;It's critical for entrepreneurs to understand the background and motivations of venture capitalists so when entrepreneurs seek them out to help fund their venture, they know what to prioritize in a firm and how to build a strong, trusting relationship,&rdquo; says Harvard Business School Senior Lecturer Jeffrey Bussgang.<\/i><br><b>a)<\/b> Identify and explain four key aspects you should emphasize when pitching your business plan to venture capitalists who may potentially fund your startup by analyzing this statement. Why are these specific areas critical to angel investors? Justify your answer. (8 marks)",
